  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "\"Sandity\" Oceanfront Escape<br><br>A 30A Dream Escape!<br><br>Located on the sought-after Highway 30A in the gated Seaside Proper Neighborhood, this stunning and tastefully decorated beach home awaits! With 3 bedrooms and 3.5 bathrooms, you and your family are sure to love every moment spent at Sandity.<br><br>Upon entry, you will be impressed by the open-concept main floor plan. Designed to perfection with high-end furnishings and elegant fixtures, no detail has gone amiss. Step into the gourmet kitchen, and the chef of the group will be delighted by the huge center island with seating and top-of-the-line appliances, including a gas stove top and a wine fridge.<br><br>The living room is luxurious, with plush couches, a large TV, a game/dining table, and plenty of windows and glass doors that allow natural light to brighten the space.<br><br>Step outside, and you will be transported into a peaceful oceanfront oasis with lounge seating on both the lower and upper-level decks. Just one house down on a private boardwalk is direct access to the private beach, where you can bring your beach chairs, water sports equipment, and snacks to enjoy a glorious afternoon under the sun.<br><br>When you are ready to retire for the night, head back to the house and up to the resort-like master suite with a king-size bed, TV, plenty of storage, a small kitchenette with a Keurig, patio access, and a gorgeous ensuite with a large vanity, and walk-in shower. The first guest bedroom offers two twin beds, while the second guest bedroom features two sets of twin bunk beds.<br><br>5 night minimum in Spring and Spring Break; 3 night minimum for Fall. Saturday-Saturday 7 night minimum for Summer.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Seaside Florida 30A Oceanfront Dream Escape!"
        }
      ],
